# Title: Security Requirements
# Applies: Code Generation, Review

- No secrets in code; load via typed settings/env.
- Validate all external inputs (Pydantic models preferred).
- Parameterized queries only.
- Hash passwords with bcrypt; tokens via `secrets`.
- HTTPS for all external communications.
- Structured logging for security events.